    K\u0101lam Varmam\n\n10.Periya Atti Curukki Varmam\n\n11.Ci\u1E5Fiya Atti Curukki
    Varmam \n\n12.Kalli\u1E6Dai K\u0101lam Varmam \n\n\n\n\n"
